<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</title><subtitle type="html">Deutsche Welle: DW.com - Top Stories</subtitle><id>https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:08:51Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss-en-top" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.dw.com/english/?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><link rel="via" href="https://rss.dw.com/xml/rss-en-top" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>Dozens missing as deadly fire hits Indonesian candy factory</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:69d326ab4b775ba9815f395c51006d11cf21e0ea99b8233d451027263e30ce7a</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:08:42Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T06:14:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/dozens-missing-as-deadly-fire-hits-indonesian-candy-factory/a-80012342--07c7cd5dbdea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/dozens-missing-as-deadly-fire-hits-indonesian-candy-factory/a-80012342?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A fire at a confectionery factory in Indonesia's Banten province has killed at least three people. Dozens are also unaccounted for after the blaze, which destroyed large parts of the facility.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>COP31: Fossil fuels still missing from draft deal at UN climate summit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:db368272f761f530843b5ebf30aec9886dbb75893b5375c9d66e7eca1a1d802c</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:08:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-22T05:50:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/cop31-fossil-fuels-still-missing-from-draft-deal-at-un-climate-summit/live-79999516--1e145f2175be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/cop31-fossil-fuels-still-missing-from-draft-deal-at-un-climate-summit/live-79999516?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The climate summit is in its second day of overtime, despite weeks of negotiations. Nations are now mulling over a new draft text that still doesn't mention fossil fuels, the main cause of global warming. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Nigeria: At least 24 dead after boat capsizes</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:45ae1ae95177391562feb89745a30173b128bf61ee4cca9bf1c0aca690c345e4</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:08:48Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T23:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nigeria-at-least-24-dead-after-boat-capsizes/a-80011248--a7e001c6016b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nigeria-at-least-24-dead-after-boat-capsizes/a-80011248?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The boat carrying mourners for a funeral overturned in southern Nigeria. It was the latest in a series of deadly boat accidents in the country.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Getting rid of antibiotic resistance: Challenges and possible solutions</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ca4103c41abad6e15e4dc4183966e0b086582eea2972dd59c16f4793ee9d1836</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T18:39:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/getting-rid-of-antibiotic-resistance-challenges-and-possible-solutions/a-80010693--ca5fce49b0a7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/getting-rid-of-antibiotic-resistance-challenges-and-possible-solutions/a-80010693?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">If antibiotics stop working, even the smallest infection can be fatal. The WHO expects millions of deaths over the next 25 years. Can the "One Health" approach help combat antibiotic resistance?</summary><category term="NRS-Import" /></entry><entry><title>Mexican special forces arrest drug kingpin 'Chapo Isidro'</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:544b6ac6336c1a1ebe4b9afeead6a9e836e0c75463ded30dfc070bdce94236e3</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T18:30:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/mexican-special-forces-arrest-drug-kingpin-chapo-isidro/a-80010745--0adb20796144.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/mexican-special-forces-arrest-drug-kingpin-chapo-isidro/a-80010745?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The alleged leader of the Beltran Leyva gang and one of the FBI's most wanted fugitives, known as "Chapo Isidro," was captured by the Mexican military following a raid and a shootout in the coastal state of Sinaloa.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian helicopter suspected of violating Finnish airspace</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6f373695d51b010644daefd08952e13f1b42d8d12cbdb2cf5943f31d0e3e23e5</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T17:08:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-helicopter-suspected-of-violating-finnish-airspace/a-80010133--74b233a91706.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-helicopter-suspected-of-violating-finnish-airspace/a-80010133?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Finland's Defense Ministry thinks the incursion is linked to a drone strike earlier Saturday on a Russian cargo ship, which is on a US sanctions list.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>EU and Indonesia sign trade deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0841e8fda1e5880bc777a10209ebbbd6e7ccd27263caaac24ab60639ab4329f6</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T15:21:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-and-indonesia-sign-trade-deal/a-80010099--bb068ad239d4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-and-indonesia-sign-trade-deal/a-80010099?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A deal covering 730 million people promises lower tariffs and new investment opportunities as the European Union seeks to diversify trade ties amid growing global economic tensions.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>New EU budget proposal aims at tax gobal tech giants</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:4bef1f277c9937f45a7fd1c0649d5f0fe569c8bc32e07717e2e80f8ee9d8d542</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T14:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/new-eu-budget-proposal-aims-at-tax-gobal-tech-giants/a-80009255--8ff3ddfff270.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/new-eu-budget-proposal-aims-at-tax-gobal-tech-giants/a-80009255?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">European Council President Antonio Costa has proposed a smaller EU budget for 2028-2034, including a 3% tax on major digital firms to ease member states' contributions. France has already rejected the plan as inadequate.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Russia strikes Zelenskyy's hometown, killing 2</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9e7da2bb2268c99e26fa8f0675917426149504d7dd8f958613c699a7cda59b37</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T14:44:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russia-strikes-zelenskyy-s-hometown-killing-2/a-80009458--1c5b88d83c35.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russia-strikes-zelenskyy-s-hometown-killing-2/a-80009458?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The attacks follow Russian President Vladimir Putin's vow of a "painful" response to Ukraine's attacks this week on the Kerch Bridge, linking Russian-occupied Crimea.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany's religious freedom report: Authoritarian regimes, holy wars, and spies abroad</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d58667bb0407098e13d3583d64de16aca736e2fb4ec2b340d166c6408ccb92b3</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T12:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-s-religious-freedom-report-authoritarian-regimes-holy-wars-and-spies-abroad/a-79995216--a4dc5259a9cd.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-s-religious-freedom-report-authoritarian-regimes-holy-wars-and-spies-abroad/a-79995216?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Harassment, persecution, surveillance: Across much of the world, people of faith are facing growing pressure. A new German government report is unusually direct in criticizing China in particular.</summary><category term="Germany" /></entry><entry><title>Anthropic researcher uses AI to solve math's greatest riddle</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:747c3c56b543dc41f50b41fdecc6c08217041d841c8ceefcb6ddc56b7ac55f3e</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T10:29:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/anthropic-researcher-uses-ai-to-solve-math-s-greatest-riddle/a-80008428--770513448c0a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/anthropic-researcher-uses-ai-to-solve-math-s-greatest-riddle/a-80008428?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The proposed breakthrough could reshape mathematical research, but still needs independent verification. It's the latest in a string of cases where AI has outpaced humans in solving famous maths problems.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Support for Ukraine military aid waning, survey shows</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f5878253fc19e881f6c2b7f8fcca58aecddb295d8e1ce970bc8c675dce69fc0b</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T10:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-support-for-ukraine-military-aid-waning-survey-shows/live-80008430--26328b4ef0e3.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-support-for-ukraine-military-aid-waning-survey-shows/live-80008430?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nearly half of Germany's population wants to reduce military aid to Ukraine, a survey has found. Meanwhile, German consumers are set to pay more in energy bills next year due in part to the Iran war. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>'Killer robots' talks at UN end with no legally binding ban</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:cf12ff5b44ac82830a45391fbe9c18357333c4c63f678f61e6557d38058bf4d3</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T09:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/killer-robots-talks-at-un-end-with-no-legally-binding-ban/a-80008584--4680bcbcf3be.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/killer-robots-talks-at-un-end-with-no-legally-binding-ban/a-80008584?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Countries have agreed to extend discussions over controls on lethal autonomous weapons systems for two years.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India: Nepal PM Balendra Shah to arrive in Delhi for first visit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:15c1c0cc24d80c50ba98bc6a2653e6ab1a63cbd58cf9558a2d69f3d92026275b</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:08:51Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T07:53:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-nepal-pm-balendra-shah-to-arrive-in-delhi-for-first-visit/live-80008104--e2d860834e27.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-nepal-pm-balendra-shah-to-arrive-in-delhi-for-first-visit/live-80008104?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Nepal's rapper-turned-prime minister Balendra Shah is in New Delhi for his first bilateral visit since taking office, with talks with Modi expected to focus on flood reconstruction aid, trade and energy. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Man convicted of arson over deadly 2025 Palisades fire in Los Angeles</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a05940f95697ba3179b5c2df4da334e5b138a8b0fc4cc484978ef032b55e75ee</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T07:10:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/man-convicted-of-arson-over-deadly-2025-palisades-fire-in-los-angeles/a-80007933--9f183d2c9cc1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/man-convicted-of-arson-over-deadly-2025-palisades-fire-in-los-angeles/a-80007933?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A 30-year-old man has been convicted of causing one of the most destructive wildfires in the history of Los Angeles. The verdict came after the case was retried.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Three El Salvador soldiers die in explosives accident in Haiti</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ca880d01f1eaaa1b52c70e0ac361a2cce6e5e23d68845383b5370355d9d1d9da</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T06:58:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/three-el-salvador-soldiers-die-in-explosives-accident-in-haiti/a-80008005--520475dc82ae.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/three-el-salvador-soldiers-die-in-explosives-accident-in-haiti/a-80008005?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The soldiers were part of a Salvadoran military contingent deployed to the violence-ridden Caribbean nation last month to rescue four missing airmen. The deployment has widened into an operation against Haiti's gangs.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil ex-President Jair Bolsonaro taken to hospital over abdominal pain</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3ae60fdd06fa3ca113367f8edc2e888e0481f75f3a0c0f4523360de9e9f49314</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T03:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-ex-president-jair-bolsonaro-taken-to-hospital-over-abdominal-pain/a-80007648--e735cc923d74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-ex-president-jair-bolsonaro-taken-to-hospital-over-abdominal-pain/a-80007648?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Jair Bolsonaro has been hospitalized in Brasilia with intestinal obstruction. The former far-right Brazilian leader is receiving pain medications, his son Carlos said.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>UK anti-migrant activist jailed for slashing Channel dinghy</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ecb4bbfd1bbbdf603974ca7dbbc980662e9f999b209aedc46be8514c5ef7163b</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T02:47:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/uk-anti-migrant-activist-jailed-for-slashing-channel-dinghy/a-80007576--c3711b9c2af1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/uk-anti-migrant-activist-jailed-for-slashing-channel-dinghy/a-80007576?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Daniel Thomas, known as "Danny Tommo," slashed a dinghy with a knife while a French rescue worker was on board. The incident was livestreamed to a large social media audience amid growing tensions over migrant crossings.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US judge approves Bayer's $7.25 billion cancer settlement</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aa148f56de7d3f9cd7ffec44990c710928f1c7061ecd8b6db69b798ef8b5fcc0</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-21T00:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-judge-approves-bayer-s-7-25-billion-cancer-settlement/a-80007474--2da6c68c9dd0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-judge-approves-bayer-s-7-25-billion-cancer-settlement/a-80007474?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bayer could end years of costly lawsuits in the US over claims that its Roundup weedkiller causes cancer. Tens of thousands of people could now receive compensation, although some lawyers say the payments are too low.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Russian ornithologist jailed over small donations to Navalny's foundation</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:803ea5b3857da0f74534ff380a42f7685c0d136d0826d18f3d5449022239a693</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:45:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/russian-ornithologist-jailed-over-small-donations-to-navalny-s-foundation/a-80005505--49dba4e1f94e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/russian-ornithologist-jailed-over-small-donations-to-navalny-s-foundation/a-80005505?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Sofia Rosenfeld has devoted her life to studying Arctic birds. A Russian court sentenced her to 3.5 years in a penal colony over donations to Navalny's foundation. Friends and family are fighting for her release.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Repression against Iranian lawyers increases</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:db4cb8c8ec3b1f10c1fba59c78c221be29a17bba13956bc7193cbd297f33f936</id><updated>2026-11-22T07:07:45Z</updated><published>2026-11-20T20:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/repression-against-iranian-lawyers-increases/a-80006742--c2e9244e707c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/repression-against-iranian-lawyers-increases/a-80006742?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">At least 135 lawyers in Iran have been subjected to repressive measures over the past year. UN experts warn that this seriously jeopardizes the right of those accused to trial in a constitutional court.</summary><category term="World" /></entry></feed>
